"WMT"=>["d"=>"וולמארט (Walmart Inc.) היא רשת הקמעונאות הגדולה בעולם עם 10,500+ חנויות ב-20 מדינות ו-eCommerce צומח, ידועה בסיסמת EDLP (Every Day Low Price).","b"=>"Walmart מרוויחה מ-merchandise sales (groceries, general merchandise, electronics), Walmart+, Sam's Club, ו-Walmart Connect (retail media). Supply chain integration מעניקה יתרון עלות.","p"=>"Walmart US supercenters, Neighborhood Markets, Sam's Club, Walmart.com, Walmart+ subscription, Walmart Connect (digital ads), PharmacyClinics, Walmart GoLocal delivery, Flipkart (הודו).","r"=>"Walmart US: ~68% הכנסות. International: ~17%. Sam's Club: ~15%. הכנסות שנתיות: 650+ מיליארד. Walmart+ ו-advertising = growth engines.","c"=>"Supply chain scale לא ניתנת לשחזור. EDLP positioning חזק בזמני recession. 1.6M US employees = distribution moat. Grocery dominance (26% US market share).","g"=>"Walmart+ growth (vs Amazon Prime). Walmart Connect advertising (retail media). Flipkart India. Automation/robotics DCs. Private label expansion.","k"=>"Amazon competition ב-e-commerce. Labor costs/wages. Margin pressure. Temu/Shein ב-general merchandise. International execution."],
"HD"=>["d"=>"הום דיפו (The Home Depot) היא רשת שיפורי הבית הגדולה בעולם עם 2,300+ חנויות בארה'ב, קנדה ומקסיקו, המשרתת קבלנים מקצועיים (Pro) ולקוחות DIY.","b"=>"Home Depot מכרת כלי בנייה, חומרי גמר, ומוצרי גינון. Pro customer (~50% הכנסות) צמח עם רכישת SRS Distribution. BOPIS (Buy Online Pick Up In Store) מוביל בענף.","p"=>"Lumber & Building Materials, Tools & Hardware, Plumbing, Electrical, Flooring, Appliances, Garden, Paint (Behr). Pro services: tool rental, delivery, installation services.","r"=>"US: ~92% הכנסות. Canada/Mexico: ~8%. Pro customers: ~50%+. E-commerce: ~15%+. Revenue: 157 מיליארד+.","c"=>"Pro customer relationships (contractors choose HD). Store density ב-US (within 10 miles for most Americans). Private label brands (Husky, Glacier Bay). Supply chain.","g"=>"Pro contractor expansion (SRS Distribution acquisition). Repair & Remodel cycle. Digital tools for Pro. Housing aging stock (40yr avg = more renovations).","k"=>"Housing market slowdown. DIY spending pullback in recession. Lowe's competition. SRS integration risk. Interest rates affect renovation spending."],
"UNH"=>["d"=>"יונייטדהלת' גרופ (UnitedHealth Group) היא חברת הבריאות הגדולה בארה'ב, המפעילת UnitedHealthcare (ביטוח בריאות) ו-Optum (שירותי בריאות ומידע).","b"=>"UNH פועלת בשני segments: UnitedHealthcare (insurance plans) ו-Optum (OptumHealth, OptumInsight, OptumRx). Vertical integration מאפשרת margin capture לאורך value chain.","p"=>"UnitedHealthcare (commercial, Medicare Advantage, Medicaid), Optum Health (care delivery), OptumRx (pharmacy benefits management), OptumInsight (data analytics), Change Healthcare.","r"=>"UnitedHealthcare: ~55% הכנסות. Optum: ~45%. Revenue: 370+ מיליארד. Medicare Advantage = מנוע צמיחה. Optum growing faster.","c"=>"Scale בלתי מושגת. Vertical integration (insurer+PBM+care delivery). Medicare Advantage market position. Data analytics (Change Healthcare). Membership network effects.","g"=>"Medicare Advantage aging demographics. Optum care clinics expansion. Value-based care. International markets. OptumRx specialty pharma.","k"=>"Change Healthcare cyberattack aftermath. Medicare Advantage rate pressure (CMS). Medical loss ratio inflation. Regulatory scrutiny. Fraud investigations."],
"LLY"=>["d"=>"אלי לילי (Eli Lilly and Company) היא חברת תרופות אמריקאית שהפכה לחברה הפארמה הגדולה בעולם לפי שווי שוק, הודות לתרופות ה-GLP-1 Mounjaro ו-Zepbound לסוכרת ולהשמנה.","b"=>"Lilly מפתחת ומוכרת תרופות מרשם לסוכרת (Mounjaro, Trulicity), השמנה (Zepbound), סרטן (Verzenio), ואלצהיימר (Donanemab). GLP-1 = מנוע צמיחה דומיננטי.","p"=>"Mounjaro (tirzepatide - סוכרת), Zepbound (tirzepatide - השמנה), Trulicity (dulaglutide), Verzenio (סרטן שד), Taltz (פסוריאזיס), Donanemab (אלצהיימר - pending), Jardiance.","r"=>"Mounjaro+Zepbound: ~50%+ הכנסות ועולה. Total Revenue: 45 מיליארד+. Growth 35%+ YoY. Pipeline מגוון.","c"=>"GLP-1 pipeline lead (tirzepatide superior efficacy vs Novo). Manufacturing scale expansion. Obesity market = $100B+ opportunity. Donanemab Alzheimer's potential.","g"=>"GLP-1 obesity treatment (Zepbound). Alzheimer's (Donanemab). Cardiovascular GLP-1 indications. Oral GLP-1 (orforglipron). New obesity pipeline.","k"=>"Manufacturing capacity constraint (can't meet demand). Novo Nordisk competition (Ozempic/Wegovy). Pricing regulation. Supply chain scaling. IRA drug pricing negotiation."],
"MRK"=>["d"=>"מרק (Merck & Co.) היא חברת תרופות אמריקאית מובילה, ידועה ב-Keytruda (pembrolizumab) - תרופת ה-checkpoint inhibitor הנמכרת ביותר בעולם לסרטן.","b"=>"Merck מוכרת תרופות מרשם (Pharmaceutical) וחיסונים (Animal Health). Keytruda מייצג ~45%+ מהכנסות. Pipeline מגוון בOncology, Vaccines, CV.","p"=>"Keytruda (pembrolizumab - immunotherapy), Gardasil (HPV vaccine), Januvia (סוכרת), Winrevair (PAH), Welireg (כליות), Lagevrio (COVID), Animal Health portfolio.","r"=>"Pharmaceutical: ~90% הכנסות. Animal Health: ~10%. Keytruda: ~45%+ ועולה. Revenue: 63 מיליארד+.","c"=>"Keytruda dominance ב-30+ cancer indications. Gardasil global vaccine. Pipeline depth (oncology). Manufacturing scale. Keytruda IP מוגן עד 2028.","g"=>"Keytruda combination therapies. Winrevair (PAH - לאחרונה אושרה). Gardasil China. ADC acquisitions (Daiichi Sankyo). Late-stage pipeline.","k"=>"Keytruda patent cliff 2028. Gardasil China slowdown. IRA drug pricing. MK-1654 ו-MK-7264 pipeline risks. Competition AstraZeneca/BMS."],
"ABBV"=>["d"=>"אבווי (AbbVie Inc.) היא חברת תרופות ביופארמה שנפרדה מ-Abbott ב-2013, ידועה בהיסטמוד של Humira ובמעבר ל-Skyrizi ו-Rinvoq כמנועי צמיחה.","b"=>"AbbVie מוכרת biologic drugs (Humira, Skyrizi, Rinvoq), oncology (Imbruvica, Venclexta) ו-aesthetics (Botox, Juvederm) לאחר רכישת Allergan ב-2020.","p"=>"Skyrizi (risankizumab - פסוריאזיס, IBD), Rinvoq (upadacitinib - דלקת מפרקים), Humira (biosimilar competition now), Imbruvica, Venclexta (CLL), Botox, Juvederm.","r"=>"Immunology (Skyrizi+Rinvoq): ~40%+. Aesthetics: ~14%. Oncology: ~12%. Humira declining. Revenue: 55 מיליארד+.","c"=>"Skyrizi+Rinvoq replace Humira ahead of schedule. Botox brand monopoly in aesthetics. Pipeline depth. Global commercial reach.","g"=>"Skyrizi IBD indication expansion. Rinvoq new indications. Emraclidine (schizophrenia) - pipeline. Aesthetics recovery. Oncology pipeline.","k"=>"Humira biosimilar erosion. Imbruvica patent/competition. Debt from Allergan acquisition. IRA drug pricing negotiation. Pipeline execution."],
"NKE"=>["d"=>"נייקי (Nike Inc.) היא מותג הספורטוויר הגדול בעולם עם 50+ מיליארד הכנסות שנתיות, ידועה ב-Swoosh, Air Jordan, Just Do It ובשיפור DTC (direct-to-consumer).","b"=>"Nike מוכרת נעליים, בגדים וציוד ספורט דרך wholesale (Foot Locker, Dick's) ו-DTC (Nike.com, Nike stores, Nike App). Jordan Brand = הנכס היוקרתי.","p"=>"Nike Air, Air Max, Air Jordan, Nike React, Nike ZoomX (running), Dri-FIT (apparel), Jordan Brand, Converse, Nike Training Club app, SNKRS app.","r"=>"Footwear: ~65% הכנסות. Apparel: ~30%. Equipment: ~5%. North America: ~43%. Europe: ~25%. Greater China: ~15%. APLA: ~17%.","c"=>"Jordan Brand מוביל בשוק sneaker culture. Swoosh brand recognition גלובלי. DTC flywheel (Nike App + SNKRS). Athlete endorsements (LeBron, Serena).","g"=>"DTC expansion (Nike.com, stores). China recovery. Running performance (Vaporfly). Women's category. Digital ecosystem.","k"=>"China slowdown. DTC transition pain (wholesale reduction). Adidas/New Balance competition. Inventory management. CEO transition."],
"KO"=>["d"=>"קוקה-קולה (The Coca-Cola Company) היא חברת המשקאות הגדולה בעולם, המחזיקה 200+ מותגים ב-200+ מדינות עם מערכת בקבוקנים עולמית.","b"=>"Coca-Cola מייצרת concentrates ו-syrups שהיא מוכרת ל-bottling partners (בקבוקנים עצמאיים). Bottlers מייצרים ומפיצים. Coca-Cola = asset-light model עם brand power.","p"=>"Coca-Cola, Diet Coke/Coke Zero, Sprite, Fanta, Minute Maid, Dasani, Smartwater, Fairlife, Bodyarmor, Monster (investment), Costa Coffee, Topo Chico.","r"=>"Concentrate/Syrup sales: ~90%+. הכנסות שנתיות: 46 מיליארד+. Organic growth driven by price/mix. Emerging markets volume growth.","c"=>"Brand value #1-2 globally ($100B+). Bottling network 200+ countries impossible to replicate. Distribution reach unmatched. Pricing power.","g"=>"Emerging markets consumption growth. Premiumization (Costa, Fairlife). Zero sugar products. Functional beverages. Streamlining portfolio.","k"=>"Health trends (sugar reduction). Competition PepsiCo. Water scarcity. Emerging market currency risk. Plastic packaging regulation."],
"IBM"=>["d"=>"ריבים (IBM - International Business Machines) היא חברת טכנולוגיה ארגונית מובילה, ממוקדת ב-Hybrid Cloud (Red Hat) ו-AI (Watsonx) לאחר שנות טרנספורמציה.","b"=>"IBM מוכרת Software (Red Hat, Hybrid Cloud), Consulting (IBM iX, GBS) ו-Infrastructure (IBM Z mainframes, IBM Power). Red Hat הפכה ל-core growth engine.","p"=>"Red Hat (OpenShift, RHEL, Ansible), IBM Watsonx (enterprise AI), IBM Z (mainframe), IBM Power, IBM Consulting, IBM Cloud (hybrid), IBM Security (QRadar).","r"=>"Software: ~42% הכנסות, margins ~80%. Consulting: ~33%. Infrastructure: ~25%. Revenue: 62 מיליארד+. Software growing, Infrastructure declining.","c"=>"Red Hat OpenShift = Kubernetes enterprise standard. IBM Z mainframe lock-in (banks, governments). Consulting relationships Fortune 500. Watsonx enterprise trust.","g"=>"Watsonx AI enterprise adoption. Red Hat OpenShift. Quantum Computing (IBM Quantum). HashiCorp acquisition. Consulting AI projects.","k"=>"Consulting margin pressure. Infrastructure secular decline. AI competition (Microsoft/Google). Red Hat competition from cloud-native. Debt from Red Hat acquisition."],
"MCD"=>["d"=>"מקדונלד'ס (McDonald's Corporation) היא רשת המסעדות הגדולה בעולם עם 40,000+ מסעדות ב-100+ מדינות, מבוססת על מודל franchise מובהק.","b"=>"McDonald's מרוויחה מ-franchise royalties (~4-5% מהכנסות הפרנצ'יז), שכר דירה מ-franchisees (בעלת הנכסים), ומ-company-owned restaurants. Asset-heavy real estate model.","p"=>"Big Mac, Quarter Pounder, McNuggets, McFlurry, McCafe (coffee), Happy Meal, Snack Wrap, Breakfast (Egg McMuffin). MyMcDonald's app (loyalty). CosMc's (spinoff).","r"=>"Franchise revenues: ~60%+ (royalties+rent). Company-owned: ~40%. Systemwide sales: $130 מיליארד+. Franchisees: 95%+ of restaurants.","c"=>"40,000 locations = distribution impossible to match. Real estate ownership מתחת למסעדות. Brand recognition global. McDonald's Rewards (loyalty).","g"=>"Digital (loyalty app 150M+ members). CosMc's spinoff (beverages). Core menu growth. Value positioning in high-inflation environment. International markets.","k"=>"Consumer trading down perception. E.coli outbreak impact. Value competition. Labor costs. Franchise relations. McDonald's as inflation gauge."],
"ORCL"=>["d"=>"אורקל (Oracle Corporation) היא ספקית תוכנת ERP ו-Database Enterprise הגדולה בעולם, שצמחה לענק Cloud Infrastructure ו-AI לאחר רכישת Cerner ופיתוח OCI.","b"=>"Oracle מוכרת Database licenses + Cloud subscriptions (OCI), Applications (Fusion ERP, NetSuite, Cerner EHR) ו-Support. Cloud transition = ARR growth.","p"=>"Oracle Database (Autonomous DB), Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI), Oracle Fusion ERP, NetSuite (SMB ERP), Cerner (healthcare EHR), Oracle Analytics, Java.","r"=>"Cloud Services + License Support: ~75%. Cloud License + On-Premise: ~12%. Hardware: ~5%. Services: ~8%. Revenue: 56 מיליארד+.","c"=>"Database lock-in (decades of enterprise data). OCI GPU clusters ל-AI (Nvidia H100). Fusion ERP switching cost. Cerner EHR moat ב-healthcare. NetSuite SMB dominance.","g"=>"OCI cloud growth (AI GPU demand). Cerner health cloud. Autonomous Database. Fusion ERP modernization. TikTok potential partnership.","k"=>"AWS/Azure/GCP OCI competition. Database open-source alternatives (PostgreSQL). Cerner integration. Larry Ellison execution concentration risk."],
"CRM"=>["d"=>"סיילספורס (Salesforce Inc.) היא מובילת ה-CRM (Customer Relationship Management) SaaS בעולם, עם 35 מיליארד+ הכנסות שנתיות ופלטפורמת Agentforce AI.","b"=>"Salesforce מוכרת CRM platform: Sales Cloud, Service Cloud, Marketing Cloud, Commerce Cloud, Slack, MuleSoft ו-Tableau, הכל ב-subscription SaaS. Agentforce = AI autonomous agents.","p"=>"Sales Cloud (CRM), Service Cloud (support), Marketing Cloud, Commerce Cloud, Slack (collaboration), MuleSoft (integration), Tableau (analytics), Einstein AI, Agentforce.","r"=>"Subscription Revenue: ~94%. Professional Services: ~6%. Revenue: 37 מיליארד+. Growth slowed, focus on profitability. Operating margin expanding.","c"=>"CRM market share #1 (20%+). Customer Success flywheel. AppExchange ecosystem (thousands of apps). Salesforce+ data trust. Switching cost: years of implementation.","g"=>"Agentforce (AI autonomous agents = next wave). Data Cloud unification. Einstein AI embedded. International expansion. Vertical Cloud (Health, Financial).","k"=>"Microsoft Dynamics + Copilot competition. Growth slowdown. Marc Benioff focus. M&A integration (Slack, Tableau). Valuation premium."],
"NOW"=>["d"=>"סרוויסנאו (ServiceNow Inc.) היא פלטפורמת IT Service Management (ITSM) ו-enterprise workflow אוטומציה, עם AI embedded ב-Now Assist.","b"=>"ServiceNow מוכרת SaaS workflows ל-enterprise: IT workflows, Employee workflows, Customer workflows ו-Creator (low-code). Renewal rates 99%+. NowAssist AI = expansion engine.","p"=>"ITSM Pro, IT Operations Management, HR Service Delivery, Customer Service Management, Now Assist (GenAI), Creator (low-code), Security Operations, GRC.","r"=>"Subscription: ~97%+ ARR. cRPO (current remaining performance obligation): 9.5 מיליארד+. Revenue: 11 מיליארד+. Growth 20%+.","c"=>"IT workflow lock-in (mission-critical). 99%+ renewal rates. Platform extensibility (single platform for IT+HR+Customer+Finance). Now Assist AI embedded.","g"=>"Now Assist GenAI (premium tier). Customer/Employee workflows expansion. Creator low-code. Federal government. Workflow automation TAM = $275B+.","k"=>"Microsoft ServiceNow competition. Valuation premium (high P/E). Growth deceleration risk. Macro: enterprise IT budget cuts. Bill McDermott execution."],
