"UBER"=>["d"=>"אובר (Uber Technologies) היא פלטפורמת mobility ו-delivery הגדולה בעולם עם 150M+ active users ב-70+ מדינות, מפעילת Uber Rides ו-Uber Eats.","b"=>"Uber גובה take-rate (~28%) על Gross Bookings מ-rides ו-delivery. Network effect: יותר נהגים = פחות המתנה = יותר users. Marketplace model רווחי לאחר שנים של הפסדים.","p"=>"Uber Rides, Uber Eats (food delivery), Uber Freight (logistics), Uber Reserve, Uber Black/XL, Uber One (membership), Uber Shuttle, Autonomous (partnerships Waymo).","r"=>"Mobility: ~58% Gross Bookings. Delivery: ~36%. Freight: ~6%. Revenue: 38 מיליארד+. Take rate improving. Profitable (Net Income positive).","c"=>"Network density ב-major cities = 3-5 min wait times. Uber Eats global restaurant network. Uber One loyalty. Driver/restaurant supply scale.","g"=>"Autonomous vehicles (Waymo partnership). Uber Eats international. Uber Freight growth. Advertising business. Uber One subscriptions.","k"=>"Driver classification (employee vs contractor) legal risk. Lyft competition in US. Regulatory in EU markets. Autonomous timeline. Delivery competition (DoorDash)."],
"F"=>["d"=>"פורד מוטור (Ford Motor Company) היא יצרנית הרכב האמריקאית השנייה בגודלה, ידועה ב-F-150 (הרכב הנמכר ביותר בארה'ב 46 שנה ברציפות) ובמעבר ל-EV עם Ford Pro.","b"=>"Ford פועלת ב-Ford Blue (ICE/hybrid), Ford Model e (EV), Ford Pro (commercial trucks/vans). Pro הוא הרווחי ביותר. Model e מפסיד בינתיים.","p"=>"F-150 (Lightning EV + ICE), Bronco, Explorer, Mustang (Mach-E EV), Transit (commercial van), Maverick pickup, Ford Pro Intelligence (connected fleet software).","r"=>"Ford Blue (ICE): ~63% הכנסות. Ford Pro: ~30%. Ford Model e (EV): ~7%. Revenue: 185 מיליארד+. Ford Credit (financing) = profit contributor.","c"=>"F-150 franchise - most profitable vehicle in history. Ford Pro B2B relationships (fleets). BlueOval SK battery JV. Brand heritage ב-trucks.","g"=>"Ford Pro commercial EV (E-Transit). F-150 Lightning ramp. Ford Pro software (Ford Pro Intelligence). Hybrid leadership (Maverick, Escape).","k"=>"EV losses (Model e -$5B+ annual loss). UAW labor costs. China competition ב-EV. Recall risk. Capital intensive EV transition."],
"GM"=>["d"=>"ג'נרל מוטורס (General Motors) היא יצרנית הרכב הגדולה בארה'ב, בעלת מותגי Chevrolet, GMC, Buick, Cadillac ו-Cruise (רכב אוטונומי).","b"=>"GM מייצרת ICE vehicles (Silverado, Tahoe, Equinox) ומתמקדת ב-EV (Ultium platform). GM Financial = profit contributor. Cruise autonomous = השקעה עתידית.","p"=>"Chevrolet Silverado, Tahoe, Equinox EV, GMC Sierra/Yukon, Cadillac Lyriq EV, Buick, OnStar, GM Financial, Cruise (autonomous - restructuring), BrightDrop.","r"=>"GMNA: ~75% הכנסות. GMI (international): ~20%. Cruise + Others: ~5%. Revenue: 190 מיליארד+. Trucks & SUVs = core profit.","c"=>"Silverado/Sierra franchise (high margin). GM Financial captive lending. Scale manufacturing. Ultium battery platform. OnStar connected services.","g"=>"EV profitability path (Ultium cost reduction). Equinox EV volume ($35K). Software defined vehicle. GM Financial growth. Cruise restart.","k"=>"EV losses. Cruise accident liability + restart costs. UAW labor costs. China (Buick/Chevy) market share loss to BYD. Ford/Stellantis competition."],
"BAC"=>["d"=>"בנק אוף אמריקה (Bank of America Corporation) הוא הבנק השני בגודלו בארה'ב לפי נכסים (3.3 טריליון), עם עסקי consumer banking, wealth management (Merrill Lynch) ו-investment banking.","b"=>"BofA פועלת ב-Consumer Banking, Global Wealth (Merrill Lynch), Global Banking (IB, loans) ו-Global Markets (trading). Responsible growth strategy תחת Brian Moynihan.","p"=>"Bank of America checking/savings, BofA credit cards, Merrill Lynch (wealth management), BofA Global Research, CashPro (treasury), Zelle, Erica (AI assistant).","r"=>"Net Interest Income: ~55%+ הכנסות. Fee income: ~45%. ROE: 10-11%. Revenue: 100 מיליארד+. Interest rate sensitive.","c"=>"Consumer banking scale (67M+ customers). Merrill Lynch $4T AUM. Digital leadership (Erica AI, 57M active digital users). Deposit base stability.","g"=>"Rate environment (NII benefit). Merrill Lynch growth. Investment banking cycle recovery. AI (Erica) deepens engagement. Organic consumer growth.","k"=>"Long-duration bond losses (unrealized). Rate sensitivity (net interest margin). Commercial real estate. Regulatory capital (Basel III). Recession credit losses."],
"CVX"=>["d"=>"שברון (Chevron Corporation) היא חברת הנפט והגז השנייה בגודלה בארה'ב, עם פעילות Upstream ו-Downstream גלובלית ופיתוח Permian Basin + Tengiz (קזחסטן).","b"=>"Chevron מייצרת ומוכרת נפט וגז גולמי (Upstream), מזקקת לדלק (Downstream), ו-petrochemicals. Hess acquisition = Guyana assets. Dividend aristocrat.","p"=>"Upstream E&P (Permian, Tengiz, Angola, Guyana pending), Downstream refineries (Richmond CA, Pascagoula), Chevron Phillips Chemical, Caltex, Renewable Natural Gas.","r"=>"Upstream: ~70% רווח. Downstream: ~20%. Chemical: ~10%. Revenue: 200 מיליארד+. Dividend: $6.52/year (4%+ yield).","c"=>"Permian Basin low-cost production. Balance sheet strength (net debt negative). Tengiz expansion (TCO). FCP discipline. Dividend track record 36+ years.","g"=>"Tengiz expansion completion. Hess/Guyana acquisition close. Permian production growth. Renewable fuels (biofuels). LNG expansion.","k"=>"Oil price cycles. Hess acquisition (Exxon arbitration). Tengiz overruns. Energy transition ESG pressure. Kazakhstan political risk."],
"PG"=>["d"=>"פרוקטר אנד גמבל (Procter & Gamble) היא ענקית המוצרים הצרכניים עם מותגים כמו Tide, Pampers, Gillette ו-Crest המוכרים ב-180+ מדינות.","b"=>"P&G מייצרת ומוכרת consumer goods דרך supermarkets, pharmacies ו-e-commerce. Premium brand portfolio מאפשר pricing power. 5 segments: Beauty, Grooming, Health, Fabric, Baby/Family.","p"=>"Tide, Ariel (laundry), Pampers (diapers), Gillette (razors), Oral-B, Crest (dental), Head & Shoulders, Pantene, Olay, Always, Febreze, Bounty, Charmin.","r"=>"Fabric & Home Care: ~35% הכנסות. Baby/Feminine/Family: ~25%. Beauty: ~18%. Health: ~13%. Grooming: ~9%. Revenue: 84 מיליארד+.","c"=>"Brand portfolio מחזק זה את זה. R&D innovation (Gillette razors, Pampers technology). Distribution global reach. Pricing power premium brands. Customer insights.","g"=>"Emerging markets premiumization. E-commerce DTC. Innovation (SK-II, premium Gillette). Private label resistance. Pricing recovery.","k"=>"Private label competition. Consumer trade-down. Emerging markets currency. Commodity input costs. Slow growth category."],
"MELI"=>["d"=>"מרקדו ליברה (MercadoLibre Inc.) היא פלטפורמת ה-e-commerce ו-Fintech הגדולה באמריקה הלטינית, הנסחרת ב-Nasdaq ומפעילת marketplace + MercadoPago.","b"=>"MercadoLibre מרוויחה מ-Commerce (marketplace fees, advertising, fulfillment) ו-Fintech (MercadoPago payment processing, credit, digital wallet, asset management).","p"=>"MercadoLibre Marketplace, MercadoPago (payments), MercadoCredito (lending), MercadoEnvíos (logistics), MercadoFondo (investments), MercadoShops (stores), MercadoAds.","r"=>"Commerce: ~55%. Fintech: ~45%. Total Revenue: 14 מיליארד+. Brazil: ~60%, Mexico: ~20%, Argentina: ~10%. Growth 35%+.","c"=>"Platform flywheel (marketplace+payments+logistics). Fintech penetration ב-underbanked markets. MercadoEnvíos (logistics owned). Brazil dominance. Network effects.","g"=>"Credit portfolio expansion (MercadoCredito). MercadoPago point of sale. Asset management (MercadoFondo). Mexico growth acceleration. Chile/Colombia expansion.","k"=>"Argentina macro instability/inflation. FX risk (multi-currency). Competition Amazon Brazil. Fintech regulation. Credit quality in downturn."],
"NTES"=>["d"=>"נטיז (NetEase Inc.) היא חברת gaming ו-internet סינית, הנסחרת ב-Nasdaq ו-HKEX, ידועה במשחקים כמו Naraka: Bladepoint, Egg Party ובמשחקים עם Blizzard.","b"=>"NetEase מרוויחה בעיקר מ-online games (PC ומובייל) בסין ובינלאומית, ממוזיקת NetEase Cloud Music, ממסחר אלקטרוני (Yanxuan) ומ-Youdao (edu-tech).","p"=>"Fantasy Westward Journey, Naraka: Bladepoint, Eggy Party, Justice, Diablo Immortal (via Blizzard JV), NetEase Cloud Music (100M+ MAU), Youdao (education), Yanxuan (e-commerce).","r"=>"Games: ~80%+ הכנסות. Music/Edu/Other: ~20%. Revenue: 100 מיליארד CNY+. International games growing.","c"=>"Library of hits ב-China + growing international. Blizzard partnership (renewed). NetEase Cloud Music lock-in. Deep China gaming relationships. Self-developed IP.","g"=>"International gaming expansion (Naraka global). New titles pipeline. NetEase Cloud Music monetization. Youdao AI tutoring. Blizzard partnership renewal.","k"=>"China gaming regulation (minors, license approvals). Tencent competition. US-China tensions (ADR). Blizzard dependency risk. FX (CNY/USD)."],
"DIS"=>["d"=>"וולט דיסני (The Walt Disney Company) היא אחת מחברות הבידור הגדולות בעולם עם Disney+, ESPN, Parks & Resorts, Marvel, Star Wars ו-Pixar.","b"=>"Disney מרוויחה מ-Entertainment (Disney+, Hulu, ESPN+, Studios) ו-Experiences (Parks, Cruises, Merchandise). Bob Iger חזר כ-CEO. Streaming profitability path.","p"=>"Disney+ (streaming), Hulu, ESPN+, ESPN (cable), Marvel Studios, Pixar, Disney Parks (Walt Disney World, Disneyland, international), Disney Cruise, Consumer Products.","r"=>"Entertainment: ~45%. Experiences (Parks): ~40%. Sports (ESPN): ~15%. Disney+ subscribers: 150M+. Revenue: 91 מיליארד+.","c"=>"IP library - Marvel, Star Wars, Pixar, Disney Princess = unmatched. Parks pricing power. Brand trust families globally. ESPN sports rights.","g"=>"Disney+ profitability. ESPN DTC transition. Parks international expansion (Abu Dhabi). Streaming ad tier. Avatar+Marvel sequels.","k"=>"Streaming competition (Netflix, Amazon). ESPN cable decline. Parks pricing elasticity. Content cost inflation. China market access."],
"PFE"=>["d"=>"פייזר (Pfizer Inc.) היא חברת תרופות ענק ידועה בחיסוני COVID-19 (Comirnaty) ובניסיון לחזור לצמיחה אורגנית לאחר ירידת הכנסות פוסט-COVID.","b"=>"Pfizer מוכרת תרופות מרשם ו-biologics. Oncology (Seagen acquisition), Vaccines, Internal Medicine ו-Biosimilars. תרופות אחרי COVID = focus area.","p"=>"Comirnaty (COVID vaccine), Paxlovid (COVID antiviral), Prevnar 20 (pneumococcal), Eliquis (אנטי-קואגולנט, עם BMS), Ibrance, Vyndaqel, Xtandi, Padcev (Seagen).","r"=>"COVID products: הכנסות ירדו דרסטית. Non-COVID: ~80%+ (2024). Revenue: 58 מיליארד (ירד מ-100B בשיא COVID). Seagen oncology = growth.","c"=>"Seagen acquisition = leading ADC oncology portfolio. Eliquis top-10 drug. Prevnar dominance. Global commercial reach. Manufacturing scale.","g"=>"Seagen ADC oncology (Padcev, Tukysa). Paxlovid revival. Pipeline RSV, flu combinations. Biosimilars (Pfizer's biosimilar line). Cost reduction.","k"=>"Eliquis LOE 2028. Post-COVID revenue normalization. Seagen integration. Stock buyback capacity limited. IRA pricing. Pipeline execution."],
"ANET"=>["d"=>"אריסטה נטוורקס (Arista Networks) היא ספקית ציוד רשת (switches, routers) ל-data centers ו-enterprise בעל ביצועי top, ידועה ב-EOS software ובצמיחה ב-AI networking.","b"=>"Arista מוכרת hardware (switches) ו-EOS (Extensible Operating System) software licenses ו-support. AI clusters (400G/800G) = next growth vector. Customers: Microsoft, Meta, Google.","p"=>"Arista EOS, 7000 Series switches (400G, 800G), CloudVision (network management), DANZ (telemetry), Cognitive Campus (enterprise), Arista Guardian (security).","r"=>"Products: ~78% הכנסות. Services: ~22%. Revenue: 6.5 מיליארד+. Growth 20%+. Gross margins: 62%+.","c"=>"EOS software architecture (single OS across all platforms - unique). AI networking leadership (800G switches). Customer loyalty (Microsoft 25%+ revenue). Cloud Titan relationships.","g"=>"AI data center networking (800G→1.6T). Campus networking. Security (DANZ). International expansion. Back-end AI network TAM explosion.","k"=>"Cisco competition in enterprise. Juniper/HPE. Customer concentration (Microsoft). Supply chain. Macro data center capex cycles."],
"DELL"=>["d"=>"דל טכנולוגיות (Dell Technologies) היא ענקית IT infrastructure ו-PC, ידועה ב-PowerEdge AI servers (עם NVIDIA GPUs) ו-Dell EMC storage, לאחר הפרדת VMware ב-2021.","b"=>"Dell מוכרת Infrastructure Solutions Group (ISG: servers, storage, networking) ו-Client Solutions Group (CSG: PCs, laptops, monitors). AI server backlog גדל דרסטית.","p"=>"PowerEdge Servers (AI GPU servers: H100, H200, B200), Dell EMC storage, PowerStore, Networking, XPS/Alienware PCs, Latitude/Precision laptops, Dell Apex (as-a-service).","r"=>"ISG: ~55% Revenue. CSG: ~45%. Revenue: 92 מיליארד+. AI server backlog: 4 מיליארד+. PC market recovery dependent.","c"=>"Direct sales model relationships Fortune 500. AI server time-to-market (quick builds). Dell EMC storage installed base. Scale procurement NVIDIA GPUs.","g"=>"AI server demand (PowerEdge ל-AI). Storage for AI data. PC refresh cycle (AI PC). Dell Apex services. ISG profitability improvement.","k"=>"PC market saturation. Margin compression ב-AI servers. HP/Lenovo competition. Supply chain NVIDIA GPU allocation. Debt from Dell-VMware transactions."],
"SQ"=>["d"=>"בלוק (Block, Inc., לשעבר Square) היא חברת Fintech של ג'ק דורסי, המפעילת Square (payments ל-merchants) ו-Cash App (digital wallet לצרכנים) ו-TBD (Bitcoin/Web3).","b"=>"Block מרוויחה מ-Square (take-rate על GPV של merchants), Cash App (transfers, investing, Bitcoin trading) ו-Afterpay (BNPL, נרכשה). Bitcoin facilitation = gross profit contribution.","p"=>"Square POS, Square Capital (merchant loans), Cash App (P2P, debit card, investing, BTC), Afterpay (BNPL), Square Banking, Weebly (website builder), TIDAL (music).","r"=>"Cash App: ~53% Gross Profit. Square: ~40%. Afterpay: ~7%. Revenue: 22 מיליארד+ (includes Bitcoin). Gross Profit: 8.9 מיליארד+.","c"=>"Cash App 57M+ monthly active users. Square POS ecosystem (merchants). Bitcoin OTC trading dominance via Cash App. Two-sided network (merchants + consumers).","g"=>"Cash App monetization (loans, debit card). Afterpay BNPL integration. Square international. Bitcoin growth (BTC treasury). TIDAL leveraged for Cash App.","k"=>"PayPal/Venmo competition. Afterpay integration complexity. Bitcoin price correlation. Jack Dorsey distraction (Bluesky). Credit quality in Cash App Borrow."]
];
